#: ../../api/flowing.plugins.workflow.rst:2
msgid "flowing.plugins.workflow package"
msgstr "flowing.plugins.workflow package"

#: flowing.plugins.workflow:1 of
msgid "``flowing.plugins.workflow`` —— 工作流编排扩展子包。"
msgstr "``flowing.plugins.workflow`` —— the workflow orchestration extension subpackage."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow:3 of
msgid ""
"本包承载工作流编排扩展的全部公开符号：:class:`Workflow` （编排器抽象 "
"基类，用户继承实现）、:class:`WorkflowPlugin` （阶段一插件）、 :class:`RunWorkflowTool` "
"（``run-workflow`` LLM 触发工具）与 :func:`resolve_workflow` （按路径解析 workflow "
"定义文件）；对外 API 经 本 ``__init__`` 统一再导出。"
msgstr ""
"This package carries all public symbols of the workflow orchestration extension: :class:`Workflow` (the orchestrator "
"abstract base class that users subclass and implement), :class:`WorkflowPlugin` (the phase-one plugin), :class:`RunWorkflowTool` "
"(the ``run-workflow`` LLM trigger tool), and :func:`resolve_workflow` (resolves workflow definition files by path); "
"the public API is uniformly re-exported through this ``__init__``."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow:9 of
msgid ""
":mod:`flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow` （Workflow 基类与 "
"模块级编排契约）、:mod:`flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin` （工具与 "
"插件）、:mod:`flowing.plugins.workflow.loader` （定义文件解析）"
msgstr ""
":mod:`flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow` (the Workflow base class and "
"the module-level orchestration contract), :mod:`flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin` (the tool and "
"the plugin), :mod:`flowing.plugins.workflow.loader` (definition file resolution)"

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow:1 of
msgid "Workflow 抽象基类——用户继承并实现 ``run()`` 的一次编排载体。"
msgstr "Workflow abstract base class —— the one-shot orchestration carrier that users subclass and implement ``run()`` on."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.loader.resolve_workflow:4
#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.RunWorkflowTool:4
