msgid "行为要点"
msgstr "Key Behaviors"

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow:45 of
msgid ""
"实例只能经“``Workflow`` 子类构造（``caller`` + ``runtime``）”创建； ``__init__`` "
"是同步方法（节点注册是结构操作）。每次运行拉起一个新 对象：workflow 无跨运行状态（运行状态不持久化，崩溃不续跑）。"
msgstr ""
"An instance can only be created via \"``Workflow`` subclass construction (``caller`` + ``runtime``)\"; ``__init__`` "
"is a synchronous method (node registration is a structural operation). Each run brings up a new object: a workflow has no cross-run state (run state is not persisted; no resumption after a crash)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow:48 of
msgid ""
"``node_id`` 构造时分配（``workflow-*`` 前缀）并注册进 "
"``runtime._nodes``，生命周期内不变；``_parent_id`` 为 ``caller.node_id`` "
"（``caller=None`` 时为 Runtime 节点 id）。"
msgstr ""
"``node_id`` is assigned at construction (``workflow-*`` prefix) and registered into "
"``runtime._nodes``; it never changes during the lifetime. ``_parent_id`` is ``caller.node_id`` "
"(the Runtime node id when ``caller=None``)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow:51 of
msgid ""
"``caller=None`` （根节点 workflow）时，一切 ``self.caller.*`` 调用 都是对 ``None`` "
"取属性，抛 ``AttributeError``——框架不预设检查， 编排代码自行保证。"
msgstr ""
"When ``caller=None`` (a root-node workflow), every ``self.caller.*`` call is an attribute access on ``None`` "
"and raises ``AttributeError`` —— the framework performs no preset check; the orchestration code must guarantee this itself."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow:54 of
msgid "``provide`` 的值对本 workflow 创建的全部 Agent 及后代可见，对其它 workflow 的子树不可见。"
msgstr "Values provided via ``provide`` are visible to all Agents created by this workflow and their descendants, but not to the subtrees of other workflows."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow:56 of
msgid "Workflow 不进消息队列、不消费消息、没有 Turn 循环、不调用 LLM。"
msgstr "A Workflow does not enter the message queue, consumes no messages, has no Turn loop, and does not call the LLM."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow:60 of
msgid ":class:`flowing.plugins.workflow.RunWorkflowTool` —— LLM 触发 入口（异步规则）。"
msgstr ":class:`flowing.plugins.workflow.RunWorkflowTool` —— the LLM trigger entry (the async rule)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow:62 of
msgid ":func:`flowing.plugins.workflow.resolve_workflow` —— 按路径 解析 workflow 定义。"
msgstr ":func:`flowing.plugins.workflow.resolve_workflow` —— resolves workflow definitions by path."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow:64 of
msgid ":class:`flowing.runtime.ProvideNode` —— provide/inject 协议。"
msgstr ":class:`flowing.runtime.ProvideNode` —— the provide/inject protocol."

#: ../../api/flowing.plugins.workflow.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.Workflow.caller:1
#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.caller:1 of
msgid ""
"发起本 workflow 的 Agent；根节点 workflow（``caller=None``）为 ``None``。可经 "
"``caller.query(...)`` 反向驱动发起方（见模块 docstring “反向驱动 caller 与异步防死锁”），或调用 "
"caller 的其它公开方法。"
msgstr ""
"The Agent that initiated this workflow; ``None`` for a root-node workflow (``caller=None``). You can reverse-drive the initiator via "
"``caller.query(...)`` (see the module docstring section \"Reverse-Driving the caller and Async Deadlock Prevention\"), or call "
"other public methods of the caller."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.Workflow.runtime:1
#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.runtime:1 of
msgid ""
"所属 Runtime（对象图根）。创建子 Agent、查工具注册表都经它；与 ``caller.runtime`` "
"恒为同一实例（``caller`` 非 None 时）。"
msgstr ""
"The owning Runtime (root of the object graph). Creating child Agents and looking up the tool registry both go through it; it is always "
"the same instance as ``caller.runtime`` (when ``caller`` is not None)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.Workflow.node_id:1
#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.node_id:1 of
msgid ""
"节点树 ID（``workflow-*`` 前缀），构造时分配并注册进 ``runtime._nodes``；本 workflow 创建的 "
"Agent 的 ``parent_id`` 指向它。"
msgstr ""
"Node tree ID (``workflow-*`` prefix), assigned at construction and registered into ``runtime._nodes``; the ``parent_id`` of "
"Agents created by this workflow points to it."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.Workflow.hooks:1
#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.hooks:1 of
msgid ""
"Workflow 自己的钩子注册表（实例级，构造时创建）。与任何 Agent 的 ``hooks`` 完全独立——Agent 侧挂的 "
"handler 不会在 workflow 的工具 调用上触发，反之亦然。``tool_call()`` 使用 "
"``before_tool_call`` / ``after_tool_call`` 两个核心钩子点。"
msgstr ""
"The Workflow's own hook registry (instance-level, created at construction). Fully independent of any Agent's ``hooks`` —— handlers "
"registered on the Agent side never fire on the workflow's tool calls, and vice versa. ``tool_call()`` uses the "
"two core hook points ``before_tool_call`` / ``after_tool_call``."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.run:1 of
msgid "编排逻辑主体——子类必须实现。"
msgstr "The orchestration logic body —— subclasses must implement it."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.run:5 of
msgid ""
"全部编排逻辑（创建/复用/销毁子 Agent、调用工具、反向驱动 caller、 并行 "
"gather、分支循环）都写在这里。参数由调用方传入，可含自然语言 ``prompt`` （通常作为子 Agent 的任务描述转发）。"
msgstr ""
"All orchestration logic (creating/reusing/destroying child Agents, calling tools, reverse-driving the caller, parallel "
"gather, branches and loops) is written here. Parameters are passed in by the caller and may include a natural-language ``prompt`` (usually forwarded to child Agents as the task description)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.run:11 of
msgid ""
"返回约定：返回 ``dict`` 表示本次运行的结果；返回 ``None`` 表示 只有编排副作用、没有结果。代码直接调用时，返回值就是 "
"``await`` 的返回值。"
msgstr ""
"Return convention: returning a ``dict`` denotes the result of this run; returning ``None`` means there were only orchestration "
"side effects and no result. When called directly from code, the return value is simply what ``await`` yields."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.run:14 of
msgid ""
"工具拉起时，本方法的返回值不进入收据与完成消息（收据与完成 消息由 :class:`RunWorkflowTool` 固定生成，见其 "
"docstring）； workflow 若要向 caller 交付结果，用 ``caller.enqueue_message(...)`` "
"自行投递。"
msgstr ""
"When launched via the tool, this method's return value does not enter the receipt or the completion message (the receipt and "
"completion message are generated in a fixed form by :class:`RunWorkflowTool`; see its docstring); if the workflow wants to "
"deliver results to the caller, it should post them itself via ``caller.enqueue_message(...)``."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.run:18 of
msgid ""
"框架不限制运行时长、节点数、并发数；不捕获本方法抛出的异常—— 异常终止本次运行并向触发方传播（工具拉起路径上体现为后台任务 "
"失败，框架不做自动重试）。"
msgstr ""
"The framework imposes no limits on run duration, node count, or concurrency, and does not catch exceptions raised by this method —— "
"an exception terminates the run and propagates to the trigger (on the tool-launched path it surfaces as a background-task failure; the framework does not auto-retry)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.run:21 of
msgid ""
"重复调用同一实例的 ``run()`` 属编程错误（每次运行应拉起新对象）； 运行中 Runtime shutdown → 本方法内创建的子 "
"Agent 随 ``destroy()`` 级联归档，未完成的 ``await`` 收到取消。"
msgstr ""
"Calling ``run()`` repeatedly on the same instance is a programming error (each run should bring up a new object); if the Runtime "
"shuts down mid-run, the child Agents created inside this method are cascade-archived by ``destroy()``, and unfinished ``await``s receive cancellation."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.run:25 of
msgid "可选的自然语言任务描述，通常转发给子 Agent 作为 任务提示词。"
msgstr "An optional natural-language task description, usually forwarded to child Agents as the task prompt."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.run:27 of
msgid ""
"其余运行参数，由调用方传入（经 ``run-workflow`` 工具拉起时即 LLM 传的参数，见 "
":class:`RunWorkflowTool`）。"
msgstr ""
"Additional run parameters, passed in by the caller (when launched via the ``run-workflow`` tool, these are the parameters "
"passed by the LLM; see :class:`RunWorkflowTool`)."

#: ../../api/flowing.plugins.workflow.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr "Returns"

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.run:29 of
msgid "workflow 结果（``dict``）或 ``None`` （纯编排副作用）。"
msgstr "The workflow result (a ``dict``) or ``None`` (pure orchestration side effects)."

#: ../../api/flowing.plugins.workflow.rst
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr "Return type"

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.run:31 of
msgid ":meth:`create_agent`、:meth:`tool_call`"
msgstr ":meth:`create_agent`, :meth:`tool_call`"

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.create_agent:1 of
msgid "创建子 Agent——Workflow 驱动 Agent 的唯一入口。"
msgstr "Create a child Agent —— the Workflow's only entry for driving Agents."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.create_agent:5 of
msgid ""
"委托 ``runtime.create_agent(agent_type, parent_id=self.node_id, "
"**kwargs)``， 走完整创建管线：``__init__`` → ``before_create`` → ``setup`` → "
"PENDING 检查 → 池元数据写盘 → ``_nodes`` 注册 → ``after_create`` → 工作循环启动。创建即入 "
"agent 池；本 workflow 把实例记入内部子 Agent 表，供 ``destroy()`` 级联归档。"
msgstr ""
"Delegates to ``runtime.create_agent(agent_type, parent_id=self.node_id, "
"**kwargs)`` and runs the full creation pipeline: ``__init__`` → ``before_create`` → ``setup`` → "
"PENDING check → pool metadata written to disk → ``_nodes`` registration → ``after_create`` → work loop start. Creation immediately enters the "
"agent pool; this workflow records the instance in its internal child-Agent table for cascaded archival by ``destroy()``. "

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.create_agent:21 of
msgid ""
"返回的 Agent 已可立即 ``message()`` / ``query()``；其 ``inject()`` 上溯链经本 "
"workflow（本 workflow ``provide()`` 的 值对它可见）。"
msgstr ""
"The returned Agent is immediately ready for ``message()`` / ``query()``; its ``inject()`` upward chain passes through this "
"workflow (values provided by this workflow's ``provide()`` are visible to it)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.create_agent:24 of
msgid ""
"不经 ``SubagentEntry.resolve()``，不触发 ``before/after_subagent_invoke`` "
"钩子（创建路径只有 ``before_create`` / ``after_create``）；``kwargs`` 不做 inject "
"式填充——原样传给子 Agent 的 ``setup()``。"
msgstr ""
"Does not go through ``SubagentEntry.resolve()`` and does not fire the ``before/after_subagent_invoke`` "
"hooks (the creation path only has ``before_create`` / ``after_create``); ``kwargs`` receive no inject-style "
"filling —— they are passed verbatim to the child Agent's ``setup()``. "

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.create_agent:28 of
msgid ""
"``agent_type`` 无法解析 → 创建管线的解析异常上抛；同名类型 重复创建产生多个独立实例（无去重——命名复用靠调用方持引用， "
"不靠类型名）。"
msgstr ""
"If ``agent_type`` cannot be resolved, the resolution exception from the creation pipeline propagates; repeatedly creating the same "
"type name yields multiple independent instances (no deduplication —— name reuse relies on the caller holding references, not on the type name)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.create_agent:32 of
msgid "子 Agent 的类型名（字符串，与 ``runtime.create_agent`` 同一契约）。"
msgstr "The type name of the child Agent (a string; same contract as ``runtime.create_agent``)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.create_agent:34 of
msgid "传给子 Agent ``setup()`` 的参数。"
msgstr "Parameters passed to the child Agent's ``setup()``. "

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.create_agent:35 of
msgid "创建完成的 ``Agent`` 实例。"
msgstr "The fully created ``Agent`` instance."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.create_agent:39 of
msgid ":meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.create_agent` —— 底层创建 路径。"
msgstr ":meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.create_agent` —— the underlying creation path."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.create_agent:41 of
msgid ""
":meth:`flowing.agent.Agent.invoke_subagent` —— Agent 侧的 LLM 唤起包装（Workflow"
" 刻意不提供）。"
msgstr ""
":meth:`flowing.agent.Agent.invoke_subagent` —— the Agent-side LLM-invocation wrapper (deliberately "
"not provided by Workflow)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.tool_call:1 of
msgid "Workflow 自己的工具调用——规范名直查注册表，独立钩子。"
msgstr "The Workflow's own tool call —— direct registry lookup by canonical name, with independent hooks."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.tool_call:5 of
msgid ""
"与 ``Agent.tool_call`` 同名但签名与语义不同：接收规范名 + 零散 参数，直接 "
"``runtime.tool_registry.get(tool_name)`` 查全局注册表， 构造 ``ToolCall`` 后经本实例的 "
"``hooks`` 走 ``before_tool_call`` / ``after_tool_call``，最后以 "
"``caller=None`` 调度工具。因为是 编排代码的直接动作（不是 LLM 决策），本路径没有别名、``ToolEntry`` "
"覆写、参数聚合与 inject 填充——``args`` 就是全部入参；也不触发 caller 或任何 Agent 的钩子（Agent 侧挂的审批"
" / 安全 / 审计 handler 不会在本路径上触发）。"
msgstr ""
"Same name as ``Agent.tool_call`` but with a different signature and semantics: takes a canonical name plus loose "
"arguments, directly looks up the global registry via ``runtime.tool_registry.get(tool_name)``, constructs a ``ToolCall`` and "
"passes it through this instance's ``hooks`` at ``before_tool_call`` / ``after_tool_call``, and finally dispatches the tool with "
"``caller=None``. Because this is a direct action of orchestration code (not an LLM decision), this path has no aliases, no "
"``ToolEntry`` overrides, no parameter aggregation, and no inject filling —— ``args`` is the entire input; it also does not fire "
"hooks of the caller or any Agent (approval / safety / audit handlers registered on the Agent side do not fire "
"on this path)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.tool_call:27 of
msgid ""
"调用时序：``tool_registry.get(tool_name)`` 命中 → 构造 "
"``ToolCall(id=f\"workflow-<8 位 hex>\", name=tool_name, args=args)`` （id "
"由框架生成，仅作追踪）→ dispatch ``before_tool_call`` （value 为 ``ToolCall``；handler "
"可改写 ``args``、可设置 ``shortcut`` 直接给出结果、可 ``raise Intercepted`` 阻断—— 阻断时返回 "
"``ToolResult.blocked(...)``，工具本体不执行）→ 调度工具 → dispatch ``after_tool_call``"
" （value 为 ``ToolResult``，可改写；``raise Intercepted`` 时返回 ``blocked``） → "
"收尾归一（return 前幂等再跑一次 ``normalize_output``，封 shortcut 与 after 改写两条缝）→ 返回最终 "
"``ToolResult``。"
msgstr ""
"Call sequence: ``tool_registry.get(tool_name)`` hits → construct "
"``ToolCall(id=f\"workflow-<8 hex chars>\", name=tool_name, args=args)`` (the id "
"is generated by the framework, for tracing only) → dispatch ``before_tool_call`` (value is the ``ToolCall``; a handler "
"may rewrite ``args``, may set ``shortcut`` to give the result directly, or may ``raise Intercepted`` to block —— when blocked it returns "
"``ToolResult.blocked(...)`` and the tool body does not execute) → dispatch the tool → dispatch ``after_tool_call`` "
"(value is the ``ToolResult`` and may be rewritten; ``raise Intercepted`` returns ``blocked``) → "
"final normalization (``normalize_output`` is run once more idempotently before return, sealing both the shortcut and the after-rewrite gaps) → return the final "
"``ToolResult``. "

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.tool_call:37 of
msgid ""
"返回值 ``status`` 四值语义与 Agent 路径一致（``completed`` / ``pending`` / ``blocked``"
" / ``error``）；``output`` 恒为归一化 五形态之一（与 ``Agent.tool_call`` 同一不变量：“出 "
"tool_call 的 ``ToolResult.output`` 恒已归一”）。"
msgstr ""
"The four-value semantics of the return value's ``status`` match the Agent path (``completed`` / ``pending`` / ``blocked`` "
"/ ``error``); ``output`` is always one of the five normalized forms (same invariant as ``Agent.tool_call``: \"the "
"``ToolResult.output`` leaving tool_call is always normalized\")."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.tool_call:41 of
msgid ""
"不查别名、不查 ``_tool_entries``、不做参数聚合；``tool_name`` 未注册 → "
":class:`flowing.errors.ToolNotFoundError`。"
msgstr ""
"No alias lookup, no ``_tool_entries`` lookup, no parameter aggregation; if ``tool_name`` is not registered → "
":class:`flowing.errors.ToolNotFoundError`."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.tool_call:43 of
msgid ""
"工具声明了 ``caller`` 参数时收到 ``None``——依赖 caller 的工具 在 workflow "
"路径上不可用（工具作者责任，框架不预设检查）。"
msgstr ""
"A tool that declares a ``caller`` parameter receives ``None`` —— caller-dependent tools are unavailable on the workflow "
"path (the tool author's responsibility; the framework performs no preset check)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.tool_call:46 of
msgid "工具规范名（注册表键）。"
msgstr "The tool's canonical name (registry key)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.tool_call:47 of
msgid "工具参数，原样作为 ``ToolCall.args``。"
msgstr "Tool arguments, passed verbatim as ``ToolCall.args``. "

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.tool_call:48 of
msgid "工具执行结果。"
msgstr "The tool execution result."

#: ../../api/flowing.plugins.workflow.rst
msgid "抛出"
msgstr "Raises"

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.tool_call:49 of
msgid "``tool_name`` 未注册时。"
msgstr "When ``tool_name`` is not registered."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.tool_call:53 of
msgid ""
":meth:`flowing.agent.Agent.tool_call` —— Agent 侧同名方法 （``ToolCall`` 入参 + "
"别名查找 + 参数聚合）。"
msgstr ""
":meth:`flowing.agent.Agent.tool_call` —— the same-named method on the Agent side (``ToolCall`` input + "
"alias lookup + parameter aggregation)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.tool_call:55 of
msgid ":class:`flowing.tool.ToolRegistry`、:class:`flowing.tool.ToolResult`"
msgstr ":class:`flowing.tool.ToolRegistry`, :class:`flowing.tool.ToolResult`"

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.provide:1 of
msgid "声明 provide 值——对本 workflow 创建的全部 Agent 及后代可见。"
msgstr "Declare a provide value —— visible to all Agents created by this workflow and their descendants."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.provide:5 of
msgid "写入本 workflow 的 provide 表；之后创建的子 Agent（及其子孙） ``inject(key)`` 沿链上溯时命中本层。"
msgstr "Writes into this workflow's provide table; subsequently created child Agents (and their descendants) hit this layer when ``inject(key)`` walks up the chain."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.provide:7 of
msgid ""
"同 key 重复 provide → 后者覆盖前者（与 ``Agent.provide`` 一致）； 对已创建的子 Agent "
"同样生效（inject 是使用时上溯，不是创建时 拷贝）。"
msgstr ""
"Repeating provide on the same key → the later value overwrites the earlier one (consistent with ``Agent.provide``); it also "
"takes effect for already-created child Agents (inject resolves upward at use time, not by copying at creation time)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.provide:10 of
msgid "不影响 caller 与其他 workflow 的子树；不参与工具 / 子 Agent 调用的参数填充（编排代码直接传参）。"
msgstr "Does not affect the caller or other workflows' subtrees; does not participate in parameter filling for tool / child Agent calls (orchestration code passes parameters directly)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.inject:11
#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.provide:13 of
msgid "注入键（字符串，或 ``InjectionKey``——按键名归一）。"
msgstr "The injection key (a string, or an ``InjectionKey`` —— normalized by key name)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.provide:14 of
msgid "注入值。"
msgstr "The injection value."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.provide:16 of
msgid ":meth:`inject`、:class:`flowing.runtime.ProvideNode`"
msgstr ":meth:`inject`, :class:`flowing.runtime.ProvideNode`"

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.inject:1 of
msgid "沿 provide 链上溯取值：本 workflow → caller（含其链）→ Runtime。"
msgstr "Resolve a value by walking up the provide chain: this workflow → caller (including its chain) → Runtime."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.inject:5 of
msgid ""
"先查本 workflow 的 provide 表，未命中沿亲代链逐级上溯（根节点 workflow 上溯一步即达 Runtime "
"层）；全链未命中抛 :class:`flowing.errors.MissingProvideError`。"
msgstr ""
"Checks this workflow's provide table first; on a miss, walks up the parent chain level by level (a root-node workflow reaches the Runtime "
"layer in one step); if the whole chain misses, raises :class:`flowing.errors.MissingProvideError`."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.inject:8 of
msgid "``InjectionKey`` 跨节点退化为按 ``name`` 匹配（类型信息不跨 节点传递）。"
msgstr "Across nodes, ``InjectionKey`` degrades to matching by ``name`` (type information does not travel across nodes)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.inject:12 of
msgid "找到的注入值。"
msgstr "The found injection value."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.inject:13 of
msgid "全链无该 key 时。"
msgstr "When the key is absent from the whole chain."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.inject:15 of
msgid ":meth:`provide`、:func:`flowing.runtime.inject_from`"
msgstr ":meth:`provide`, :func:`flowing.runtime.inject_from`"

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.destroy:1 of
msgid "销毁本 workflow：级联归档未销毁的子 Agent，并从 ``runtime._nodes`` 注销。"
msgstr "Destroy this workflow: cascade-archives child Agents not yet destroyed, and unregisters from ``runtime._nodes``. "

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.destroy:5 of
msgid ""
"逐个 ``await runtime.archive_agent(child_id)``：归档把子 Agent 从 ``_nodes`` / "
"``_agent_pool`` / ``core`` 名录移除、session 文件保留（Workflow 一次调用即弃，子 Agent "
"不留可恢复的池条目）； 随后清空内部子 Agent 表并注销本节点。重复调用为空操作（幂等）。"
msgstr ""
"Performs ``await runtime.archive_agent(child_id)`` one by one: archival removes a child Agent from the ``_nodes`` / "
"``_agent_pool`` / ``core`` rosters while keeping its session file (a Workflow is discarded after one call; child Agents keep no "
"recoverable pool entries); it then clears the internal child-Agent table and unregisters this node. Repeated calls are a no-op (idempotent)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.destroy:9 of
msgid ""
"不删除子 Agent 的 session 文件（归档留档）；不取消经 :class:`RunWorkflowTool` "
"拉起的其他运行实例（每次运行是独立 对象）。"
msgstr ""
"Does not delete child Agents' session files (archival keeps them on record); does not cancel other running instances launched via "
":class:`RunWorkflowTool` (each run is an independent object)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.destroy:12 of
msgid ""
"销毁时 ``run()`` 仍在执行 → 子 Agent 被级联归档，``run()`` 内的 ``await`` "
"陆续收到取消或销毁后的错误——编排代码应自行保证 销毁时机（框架不预设）。"
msgstr ""
"If ``run()`` is still executing at destruction → child Agents are cascade-archived, and the ``await``s inside ``run()`` "
"successively receive cancellation or post-destruction errors —— orchestration code should guarantee the destruction timing itself (not preset by the framework)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow.Workflow.destroy:16 of
msgid ""
":meth:`flowing.agent.Agent.destroy`、 "
":meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.archive_agent`、:meth:`create_agent`"
msgstr ""
":meth:`flowing.agent.Agent.destroy`, "
":meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.archive_agent`, :meth:`create_agent`"

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.WorkflowPlugin:1 of
msgid "Workflow 扩展插件——阶段一入口：注册 ``run-workflow`` 工具并提供 Workflow 根创建入口。"
msgstr "Workflow extension plugin —— the phase-one entry: registers the ``run-workflow`` tool and provides the Workflow root creation entry."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.WorkflowPlugin:5 of
msgid ""
"``runtime.install(WorkflowPlugin())`` 时框架调用 ``install(runtime)``： 向 "
"``runtime.tool_registry`` 注册 :class:`RunWorkflowTool`，并保存 runtime 引用（供 "
":meth:`launch` 使用）。之后 Agent 经 ``add_tool(\"run-workflow\")`` 绑定该工具，即可让 "
"LLM 按路径拉起 任意 workflow 定义；宿主 / 应用代码经 ``runtime.get_plugin(\"workflow\") "
".launch(path)`` 创建 Workflow 根。"
msgstr ""
"When ``runtime.install(WorkflowPlugin())`` runs, the framework calls ``install(runtime)``: it registers "
":class:`RunWorkflowTool` into ``runtime.tool_registry`` and saves the runtime reference (for "
":meth:`launch`). Afterwards an Agent binds the tool via ``add_tool(\"run-workflow\")``, letting the "
"LLM launch any workflow definition by path; host / application code creates a Workflow root via ``runtime.get_plugin(\"workflow\") "
".launch(path)``. "

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.WorkflowPlugin:12 of
msgid ""
"Workflow 的能力本体是 :class:`Workflow` 基类（import 即用，不需要 实例级启用）；本插件负责两件事：把 LLM "
"触发入口接上（``run-workflow`` 工具），以及提供 Workflow 根创建入口（``launch``，需注册以取得 "
"runtime）。不需要 LLM 入口、也不建根（纯代码驱动子节点）的应用可以 不安装本插件，``Workflow`` 基类与 "
":func:`resolve_workflow` 照常可用。"
msgstr ""
"The capability body of Workflow is the :class:`Workflow` base class (usable on import, with no instance-level "
"activation needed); this plugin is responsible for two things: wiring up the LLM trigger entry (the "
"``run-workflow`` tool), and providing the Workflow root creation entry (``launch``, which requires registration to obtain the "
"runtime). Applications that need neither the LLM entry nor a root (purely code-driven child nodes) may skip installing "
"this plugin —— the ``Workflow`` base class and :func:`resolve_workflow` remain usable as usual."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.WorkflowPlugin:31 of
msgid ""
"``install()`` 同步完成：注册工具 + 保存 runtime；不创建任何 workflow 实例、不扫描任何目录（资源发现发生在 "
":func:`resolve_workflow` 被调用时）。"
msgstr ""
"``install()`` completes synchronously: registers the tool + saves the runtime; it creates no workflow instance and scans no "
"directory (resource discovery happens when :func:`resolve_workflow` is called)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.WorkflowPlugin:34 of
msgid ""
":meth:`launch` 依赖 install 保存的 runtime——未注册（未 "
"``runtime.install(WorkflowPlugin())``）时调用抛 ``ValueError``。"
msgstr ""
":meth:`launch` depends on the runtime saved by install —— when not registered (``runtime.install(WorkflowPlugin())`` "
"not called), invoking it raises ``ValueError``. "

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.WorkflowPlugin:36 of
msgid "本插件不声明钩子点、不挂任何 handler；不注册 provide 值、不声明 Agent 状态键。"
msgstr "This plugin declares no hook points and attaches no handlers; it registers no provide values and declares no Agent state keys."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.WorkflowPlugin:38 of
msgid ""
"重复安装同名插件（再次 ``runtime.install(WorkflowPlugin())``）抛 ``ValueError`` "
"（``Runtime.install`` 的同名插件查重）。"
msgstr ""
"Installing a plugin with the same name again (another ``runtime.install(WorkflowPlugin())``) raises ``ValueError`` "
"(``Runtime.install``'s same-name plugin dedup check)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.WorkflowPlugin:40 of
msgid ""
"工具规范名 ``run-workflow`` 已被注册时 → "
":class:`flowing.errors.ToolNameConflictError`。"
msgstr ""
"When the canonical tool name ``run-workflow`` is already registered → "
":class:`flowing.errors.ToolNameConflictError`."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.WorkflowPlugin:43 of
msgid "工具规范名 ``run-workflow`` 已被注册时。"
msgstr "When the canonical tool name ``run-workflow`` is already registered."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.WorkflowPlugin:48 of
msgid ":class:`RunWorkflowTool`、:class:`Workflow`"
msgstr ":class:`RunWorkflowTool`, :class:`Workflow`"

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.WorkflowPlugin:49 of
msgid ":class:`flowing.plugins.Plugin` —— 插件基类契约。"
msgstr ":class:`flowing.plugins.Plugin` —— the plugin base class contract."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.WorkflowPlugin.name:1
#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.WorkflowPlugin.name:1 of
msgid ""
"注册名（显式声明，无框架默认）。推荐格式：类名去 ``Plugin`` 后缀转 kebab-case（``WorkflowPlugin`` → "
"``\"workflow\"``）。"
msgstr ""
"The registration name (explicitly declared, no framework default). Recommended format: class name minus the ``Plugin`` suffix, converted to "
"kebab-case (``WorkflowPlugin`` → ``\"workflow\"``)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.WorkflowPlugin.dependencies:1
#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.WorkflowPlugin.dependencies:1 of
msgid "依赖声明（类属性元数据）。本插件无依赖，为空列表。"
msgstr "Dependency declaration (class-attribute metadata). This plugin has no dependencies; the list is empty."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.WorkflowPlugin.dependencies:3
#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.WorkflowPlugin.dependencies:3 of
msgid ":meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.install` —— 依赖校验在该 方法内执行。"
msgstr ":meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.install` —— dependency validation is performed inside that method."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.WorkflowPlugin.install:1 of
msgid "阶段一：注册 ``run-workflow`` 工具并保存 runtime（供 ``launch`` 使用）。"
msgstr "Phase one: registers the ``run-workflow`` tool and saves the runtime (for ``launch``)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.WorkflowPlugin.install:5 of
msgid ""
"``runtime.register_tool(RunWorkflowTool())``，同步返回；不创建 任何 workflow "
"实例、不扫描任何目录（资源发现发生在 :func:`resolve_workflow` 被调用时）。"
msgstr ""
"``runtime.register_tool(RunWorkflowTool())``, returning synchronously; creates no workflow "
"instance and scans no directory (resource discovery happens when :func:`resolve_workflow` is called)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.WorkflowPlugin.install:8 of
msgid ""
"保存 ``runtime`` 到 :attr:`_runtime`——:meth:`launch` 创建 Workflow "
"根时以此构造（root：``caller=None``）。"
msgstr ""
"Saves ``runtime`` to :attr:`_runtime` —— :meth:`launch` uses it to construct the Workflow "
"root (root: ``caller=None``)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.WorkflowPlugin.install:11 of
msgid ":class:`RunWorkflowTool`、:meth:`launch`"
msgstr ":class:`RunWorkflowTool`, :meth:`launch`"

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.WorkflowPlugin.launch:1 of
msgid "按 Workflow 定义文件创建 Workflow 根（``caller=None`` 的根节点）。"
msgstr "Create a Workflow root (a root node with ``caller=None``) from a Workflow definition file."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.WorkflowPlugin.launch:5 of
msgid ""
"Workflow 根的创建入口（原 ``Runtime.mount`` 的 Workflow 等价路径 "
"迁移至此）：``resolve_workflow(path)`` 解析定义文件（文件内需恰好 一个 ``Workflow`` 子类），以 "
"``caller=None``（根节点语义）与注册 时保存的 runtime 实例化。返回的 Workflow 已就位于节点树与 provide "
"链（构造即完成，见 :class:`Workflow`）。"
msgstr ""
"The creation entry for a Workflow root (the Workflow-equivalent path of the former ``Runtime.mount`` "
"has been migrated here): ``resolve_workflow(path)`` resolves the definition file (which must contain exactly "
"one ``Workflow`` subclass) and instantiates it with ``caller=None`` (root-node semantics) and the runtime saved at "
"registration. The returned Workflow is already in place in the node tree and the provide chain (done at construction; see :class:`Workflow`)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.WorkflowPlugin.launch:21 of
msgid ""
"前置条件：本插件已注册（``runtime.install(WorkflowPlugin())``）—— 未注册时抛 "
":class:`ValueError`（launch 依赖 install 保存的 runtime）。"
msgstr ""
"Precondition: this plugin is registered (``runtime.install(WorkflowPlugin())``) —— otherwise it raises "
":class:`ValueError` (launch depends on the runtime saved by install)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.WorkflowPlugin.launch:24 of
msgid ""
"``caller=None``：Workflow 是根节点（``_parent_id`` 指向 Runtime）；经 ``run-"
"workflow`` 工具拉起的 Workflow 由调用方 Agent 作 ``caller``，走 "
":class:`RunWorkflowTool` 的构造路径 （与 launch 同为 ``workflow_class(caller, "
"runtime)`` 形态）。"
msgstr ""
"``caller=None``: the Workflow is a root node (``_parent_id`` points at the Runtime); a Workflow launched via the "
"``run-workflow`` tool takes the calling Agent as ``caller`` and goes through :class:`RunWorkflowTool`'s "
"construction path (the same ``workflow_class(caller, runtime)`` form as "
"launch)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.WorkflowPlugin.launch:28 of
msgid ""
"同步方法：Workflow 构造是同步的（分配 ``node_id``、就位节点树 与 provide "
"链）；不传额外构造参数（``Workflow.__init__`` 固定 ``(caller, runtime)`` "
"两参，子类初始化参数由定义文件 / 默认值 承载）。"
msgstr ""
"Synchronous method: Workflow construction is synchronous (assigns ``node_id`` and takes its place in the node tree and the provide "
"chain); no extra construction parameters are accepted (``Workflow.__init__`` is fixed at the two parameters ``(caller, runtime)``; "
"subclass initialization parameters are carried by the definition file / default values)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.WorkflowPlugin.launch:33 of
msgid "Workflow 定义文件路径（支持 ``@/`` 前缀规则）。"
msgstr "Path to the Workflow definition file (supports the ``@/`` prefix rule)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.WorkflowPlugin.launch:34 of
msgid "已就位的 ``Workflow`` 根实例。"
msgstr "The in-place ``Workflow`` root instance."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.WorkflowPlugin.launch:35 of
msgid "本插件未注册（``runtime.install(WorkflowPlugin())`` 未调用）时。"
msgstr "When this plugin is not registered (``runtime.install(WorkflowPlugin())`` was not called)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.WorkflowPlugin.launch:37 of
msgid "路径缺失或文件形态不合法时 （经 :func:`resolve_workflow`）。"
msgstr "When the path is missing or the file form is invalid (via :func:`resolve_workflow`)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.WorkflowPlugin.launch:40 of
msgid ":func:`resolve_workflow`、:class:`Workflow`、 :class:`RunWorkflowTool`"
msgstr ":func:`resolve_workflow`, :class:`Workflow`, :class:`RunWorkflowTool`"

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.RunWorkflowTool:1 of
msgid "内置 ``run-workflow`` 工具——Workflow 的 LLM 触发入口（async generator 形态）。"
msgstr "The builtin ``run-workflow`` tool —— Workflow's LLM trigger entry (async generator form)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.RunWorkflowTool:5 of
msgid ""
"LLM 传 workflow 定义文件路径 + 运行参数（可含自然语言 prompt），本 工具按路径解析 workflow "
"定义、实例化，以后台任务方式启动 ``run()`` 并立即返回收据；由 :class:`WorkflowPlugin` 在 "
"``install()`` 时注册进 全局工具注册表，Agent 经 ``add_tool(\"run-workflow\")`` 绑定后即可被 "
"LLM 调用。"
msgstr ""
"The LLM passes a workflow definition file path + run parameters (which may include a natural-language prompt); this tool "
"resolves the workflow definition by path, instantiates it, starts ``run()`` as a background task, and returns a receipt "
"immediately; it is registered into the global tool registry by :class:`WorkflowPlugin` at "
"``install()`` time, and once an Agent binds it via ``add_tool(\"run-workflow\")`` it can be called by the "
"LLM."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.RunWorkflowTool:11 of
msgid ""
"执行体是 async generator（该形态的契约见 :class:`flowing.tool.ScriptTool` 类 "
"docstring“后台工具形态”）：第一 个 ``yield`` 是收据（``Tool.__call__`` 等它作为 ``pending`` "
"收据）， 之后的运行段由框架后台驱动，后续 ``yield`` 逐段投递 EVENT 消息。 工具声明上使用类级 ``definition`` "
"显式给出，``strict=False``—— ``run-workflow`` 的运行参数不止 ``path``，其余由 "
"``Workflow.run()`` 签名决定，工具层不做参数限制。"
msgstr ""
"The execution body is an async generator (the contract of this form is in the :class:`flowing.tool.ScriptTool` class "
"docstring, section \"Background Tool Form\"): the first ``yield`` is the receipt (``Tool.__call__`` awaits it as the "
"``pending`` receipt); the subsequent run segment is driven by the framework in the background, and later ``yield``s deliver "
"EVENT messages segment by segment. The tool declaration is given explicitly via the class-level ``definition`` with "
"``strict=False`` —— ``run-workflow``'s run parameters go beyond ``path``; the rest are determined by the "
"``Workflow.run()`` signature, and the tool layer imposes no parameter restrictions."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.RunWorkflowTool:21 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"首 yield 前只做轻量准备：``resolve_workflow(path)`` → 实例化 ``wf_class(caller, "
"caller.runtime)``。首 yield 产出收据 ``{\"status\": \"started\", \"workflow\": "
"<path>}``，框架包装为 ``status=\"pending\"`` 的 ``ToolResult`` 并携带后台任务注册键 "
"（``background_task_id``）；收据在 ``run()`` 完成之前返回。"
msgstr ""
"Before the first yield, only lightweight preparation happens: ``resolve_workflow(path)`` → instantiate ``wf_class(caller, "
"caller.runtime)``. The first yield produces the receipt ``{\"status\": \"started\", \"workflow\": "
"<path>}``, which the framework wraps as a ``status=\"pending\"`` ``ToolResult`` carrying the background-task registration key "
"(``background_task_id``); the receipt is returned before ``run()`` completes."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.RunWorkflowTool:26 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"后台运行段执行 ``await instance.run(**args)`` （``path`` 不从 ``args`` 透传给 "
"``run()``）；完成时末 yield 产出 ``{\"status\": \"done\", \"workflow\": "
"<path>}``，框架投递为 EVENT 消息 （LLM 可见）。"
msgstr ""
"The background run segment executes ``await instance.run(**args)`` (``path`` is not forwarded from ``args`` to "
"``run()``); on completion the final yield produces ``{\"status\": \"done\", \"workflow\": "
"<path>}``, which the framework delivers as an EVENT message (visible to the LLM)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.RunWorkflowTool:30 of
msgid ""
"workflow 的数据结果不由本工具交付——编排代码自行 ``caller.enqueue_message(...)`` "
"投递（框架的完成消息与编排的结果 消息两条并存，角色不同：状态 vs 数据）。"
msgstr ""
"The workflow's data result is not delivered by this tool —— orchestration code posts it itself via ``caller.enqueue_message(...)`` "
"(the framework's completion message and the orchestration's result message coexist, with different roles: status vs data)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.RunWorkflowTool:33 of
msgid ""
"``path`` 解析失败（首 yield 前异常）→ ``Tool.__call__`` 按 except "
"顺序分派：``Intercepted`` → ``blocked``、其余 → ``status=\"error\"`` 的 LLM "
"可见结果；后台运行段异常（``run()`` 抛错）→ 框架投递 EVENT 错误块 + 诊断日志（双通道，LLM 可见）。"
msgstr ""
"If ``path`` resolution fails (an exception before the first yield) → ``Tool.__call__`` dispatches in except "
"order: ``Intercepted`` → ``blocked``; everything else → an LLM-visible result with ``status=\"error\"``; "
"an exception in the background run segment (``run()`` raising) → the framework delivers an EVENT error block + a diagnostic log (two channels, both LLM-visible)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.RunWorkflowTool:37 of
msgid "本工具不等待运行完成（收据立即返回）；不持久化运行状态；不做并发 数 / 节点数上限检查。"
msgstr "This tool does not wait for the run to complete (the receipt returns immediately); it does not persist run state; it performs no concurrency / node-count limit checks."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.RunWorkflowTool:42 of
msgid ":class:`Workflow` —— 被拉起的对象。"
msgstr ":class:`Workflow` —— the object being launched."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.RunWorkflowTool:43 of
msgid ":func:`resolve_workflow` —— 按路径解析 workflow 定义。"
msgstr ":func:`resolve_workflow` —— resolves workflow definitions by path."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.RunWorkflowTool:44 of
msgid ":class:`flowing.tool.ScriptTool` —— 基类（async generator 形态契约见其类 docstring）。"
msgstr ":class:`flowing.tool.ScriptTool` —— the base class (the async generator form contract is in its class docstring)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.RunWorkflowTool.definition:1
#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.RunWorkflowTool.definition:1 of
msgid ""
"类级默认声明：规范名 ``run-workflow``、参数表只含 ``path``、 ``strict=False``——运行参数由 "
"``Workflow.run()`` 签名决定，工具层 不做参数限制（与 "
":class:`flowing.plugins.skills.SkillLoadTool` 同构的“薄入口 + 内层校验”形态）。"
msgstr ""
"Class-level default declaration: canonical name ``run-workflow``, parameter table containing only ``path``, "
"``strict=False`` —— the run parameters are determined by the ``Workflow.run()`` signature, and the tool layer "
"imposes no parameter restrictions (a \"thin entry + inner validation\" form isomorphic to "
":class:`flowing.plugins.skills.SkillLoadTool`)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.RunWorkflowTool.execute:1 of
msgid "async generator 形态后台启动指定 workflow（语义见类 docstring）。"
msgstr "Starts the specified workflow in the background in async generator form (semantics in the class docstring)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.RunWorkflowTool.execute:5 of
msgid ""
"首 yield 前（轻量准备）：``resolve_workflow(path)`` → 实例化 ``wf_class(caller, "
"caller.runtime)``——异常经 ``Tool.__call__`` 的 except 顺序分派（``Intercepted`` → "
"``blocked``；其余 → ``status=\"error\"`` 的 LLM 可见结果）。"
msgstr ""
"Before the first yield (lightweight preparation): ``resolve_workflow(path)`` → instantiate ``wf_class(caller, "
"caller.runtime)`` —— exceptions are dispatched in the except order of ``Tool.__call__`` (``Intercepted`` → "
"``blocked``; everything else → an LLM-visible result with ``status=\"error\"``)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.RunWorkflowTool.execute:9 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"首 yield：收据 ``{\"status\": \"started\", \"workflow\": path}`` （框架包装为 "
"``status=\"pending\"`` 的 ``ToolResult`` 并携带后台 任务注册键）。"
msgstr ""
"First yield: the receipt ``{\"status\": \"started\", \"workflow\": path}`` (wrapped by the framework as a "
"``status=\"pending\"`` ``ToolResult`` carrying the background-task registration key)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.RunWorkflowTool.execute:12 of
msgid ""
"后台运行段：``await instance.run(**args)`` （由框架后台驱动； ``path`` 不从 ``args`` 透传给 "
"``run()``）。"
msgstr ""
"Background run segment: ``await instance.run(**args)`` (driven by the framework in the background; ``path`` is not "
"forwarded from ``args`` to ``run()``)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.RunWorkflowTool.execute:14 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"末 yield：最终呈现 ``{\"status\": \"done\", \"workflow\": path}`` （框架投递为 EVENT "
"消息，LLM 可见）；运行段异常由框架投递 EVENT 错误块 + 诊断日志（双通道，LLM 可见）。"
msgstr ""
"Final yield: the final presentation ``{\"status\": \"done\", \"workflow\": path}`` (delivered by the framework as an EVENT "
"message, visible to the LLM); exceptions in the run segment are delivered by the framework as an EVENT error block + a diagnostic log (two channels, both LLM-visible)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.RunWorkflowTool.execute:17 of
msgid "本方法不等待运行完成；不把 ``run()`` 的返回值写进收据。"
msgstr "This method does not wait for the run to complete; it does not write ``run()``'s return value into the receipt."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.RunWorkflowTool.execute:19 of
msgid "workflow 定义文件路径（支持 ``@/`` 前缀）。"
msgstr "Path to the workflow definition file (supports the ``@/`` prefix)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.RunWorkflowTool.execute:20 of
msgid "调用方 Agent（LLM 入口恒非 None）。"
msgstr "The calling Agent (always non-None on the LLM entry)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.RunWorkflowTool.execute:21 of
msgid "传给 ``Workflow.run()`` 的运行参数。"
msgstr "Run parameters passed to ``Workflow.run()``. "

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin.RunWorkflowTool.execute:23 of
msgid ":func:`resolve_workflow`、:meth:`Workflow.run`"
msgstr ":func:`resolve_workflow`, :meth:`Workflow.run`"

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.loader.resolve_workflow:1 of
msgid "按路径解析 workflow 定义文件，返回 ``Workflow`` 子类（类对象，不实例化）。"
msgstr "Resolve a workflow definition file by path and return the ``Workflow`` subclass (the class object, not instantiated)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.loader.resolve_workflow:5 of
msgid ""
"``path`` 指向一个 workflow 定义文件，本函数返回该文件中定义的 :class:`Workflow` "
"子类。查找发生在调用时刻：不做启动期扫描、不缓存， workflow 文件可以放在任意位置，没有默认目录约定（面对任务即时写下的 "
"新文件也可以直接引用）。接受两种路径写法："
msgstr ""
"``path`` points to a workflow definition file, and this function returns the :class:`Workflow` "
"subclass defined in that file. The lookup happens at call time: no startup scan, no caching; workflow files can live "
"anywhere, with no default directory convention (a new file written on the spot for the task can also be referenced directly). Two path notations are accepted:"

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.loader.resolve_workflow:10 of
msgid ""
"绝对路径，或 ``@/`` 前缀的项目根相对路径（基准为 ``project_root`` 参数——调用方传入 Runtime 固化的 "
"``project_root``），如 ``\"@/flows/verify_fix.py\"``；"
msgstr ""
"An absolute path, or a project-root-relative path with the ``@/`` prefix (based on the ``project_root`` parameter —— the caller passes the Runtime's fixed "
"``project_root``), e.g. ``\"@/flows/verify_fix.py\"``;"

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.loader.resolve_workflow:13 of
msgid ""
"无 ``.py`` 后缀的 kebab-case 路径，如 ``\"@/flows/verify-fix\"``： 先按原样补 ``.py`` "
"（``flows/verify-fix.py``），未命中再把连字符转 下划线补 ``.py`` "
"（``flows/verify_fix.py``）；两个候选同时存在属 歧义，抛 "
":class:`flowing.errors.FlowingError`。"
msgstr ""
"A kebab-case path without the ``.py`` suffix, e.g. ``\"@/flows/verify-fix\"``: first append ``.py`` as-is "
"(``flows/verify-fix.py``); on a miss, convert hyphens to underscores and append ``.py`` "
"(``flows/verify_fix.py``); if both candidates exist it is ambiguous and raises "
":class:`flowing.errors.FlowingError`."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.loader.resolve_workflow:18 of
msgid "定义文件两种形态（加载时判定，互斥）："
msgstr "Two forms of definition file (determined at load time, mutually exclusive):"

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.loader.resolve_workflow:20 of
msgid ""
"类形态：文件内恰好一个由该文件自身定义的 ``Workflow`` 子类 （import 进来的他处子类不计）——直接返回该类；文件同时存在顶层 "
"``run`` 函数时忽略函数（类形态优先）。"
msgstr ""
"Class form: the file contains exactly one ``Workflow`` subclass defined by the file itself (subclasses imported from elsewhere "
"do not count) —— return that class directly; if the file also has a top-level ``run`` function, the function is ignored (the class form takes precedence)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.loader.resolve_workflow:23 of
msgid ""
"函数形态：文件内没有 ``Workflow`` 子类，但有一个顶层 ``async def run(prompt=None, ...)`` （不带"
" ``self`` 参数）—— 编译为生成的 ``Workflow`` 子类后返回。函数形态下 ``run`` 体内可 直接调用 "
"``create_agent(...)`` （简写 ``agent(...)`` 等价）与 ``tool_call(...)``，免写 "
"``self.`` 前缀与 import；生成类名由文件 名推导（kebab-case 转 PascalCase，如 ``verify-"
"fix.py`` → ``VerifyFix``）。"
msgstr ""
"Function form: the file has no ``Workflow`` subclass but has a top-level ``async def run(prompt=None, ...)`` (without "
"a ``self`` parameter) —— it is compiled into a generated ``Workflow`` subclass and returned. In the function form, the body of ``run`` may call "
"``create_agent(...)`` (the shorthand ``agent(...)`` is equivalent) and ``tool_call(...)`` directly, with no "
"``self.`` prefix or imports needed; the generated class name is derived from the file name (kebab-case to PascalCase, e.g. ``verify-"
"fix.py`` → ``VerifyFix``)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.loader.resolve_workflow:53 of
msgid ""
"本函数对调用方的承诺是“要么返回合法的 ``Workflow`` 子类，要么抛出 带定位信息的异常”：不返回 "
"``None``、不返回占位对象、不静默降级。 代码直接调用方依赖异常控制流，无需判空返回值。经 ``run-workflow`` 工具（LLM "
"入口）调用时，同一异常由工具层包装为 ``status=\"error\"`` 的 LLM 可见结果——包装只发生在工具边界。"
msgstr ""
"This function's promise to callers is \"either return a valid ``Workflow`` subclass, or raise an exception with locating "
"information\": it never returns ``None``, never returns a placeholder object, and never silently degrades. Direct code callers "
"rely on exception control flow and need no null check on the return value. When invoked via the ``run-workflow`` tool (the LLM entry), "
"the same exception is wrapped by the tool layer into an LLM-visible result with ``status=\"error\"`` —— the wrapping happens only at the tool boundary."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.loader.resolve_workflow:58 of
msgid ""
"路径不存在 → :class:`flowing.errors.FlowingError` （消息含解析后的 路径）；文件内有两个以上本文件定义的 "
"``Workflow`` 子类、或既无子类 又无顶层 ``run`` 函数 → 同样抛 ``FlowingError`` （消息说明歧义或 "
"缺失）。"
msgstr ""
"If the path does not exist → :class:`flowing.errors.FlowingError` (the message contains the resolved path); if the file "
"contains two or more ``Workflow`` subclasses defined by the file itself, or has neither a subclass nor a top-level ``run`` "
"function → it likewise raises ``FlowingError`` (the message explains the ambiguity or the "
"absence)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.loader.resolve_workflow:62 of
msgid "文件顶层语句随加载执行一次（与 ``.fya`` 加载一致）；每次调用现场 解析，无缓存。"
msgstr "The file's top-level statements execute once at load time (consistent with ``.fya`` loading); each call resolves on the spot, with no caching."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.loader.resolve_workflow:64 of
msgid "``@/`` 前缀且 ``project_root`` 缺失（裸进程直接调用、未传基准）时抛 ``ValueError``。"
msgstr "When an ``@/`` prefix is used and ``project_root`` is missing (a direct call from a bare process without a base passed), raises ``ValueError``. "

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.loader.resolve_workflow:67 of
msgid "workflow 定义文件的路径（支持 ``@/`` 前缀）。"
msgstr "Path to the workflow definition file (supports the ``@/`` prefix)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.loader.resolve_workflow:68 of
msgid "``@/`` 前缀的解析基准；缺省为 ``None`` ——此时 ``@/`` 路径抛 ``ValueError``，其余形态照常。"
msgstr "The resolution base for the ``@/`` prefix; defaults to ``None`` —— in that case ``@/`` paths raise ``ValueError`` and other forms work as usual."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.loader.resolve_workflow:70 of
msgid "文件中定义的 ``Workflow`` 子类（类对象，不实例化）。"
msgstr "The ``Workflow`` subclass defined in the file (the class object, not instantiated)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.loader.resolve_workflow:71 of
msgid "路径缺失或文件形态不合法时。"
msgstr "When the path is missing or the file form is invalid."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.loader.resolve_workflow:72 of
msgid "``@/`` 路径且 ``project_root`` 缺失时。"
msgstr "When an ``@/`` path is used and ``project_root`` is missing."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.loader.resolve_workflow:74 of
msgid ""
":class:`flowing.plugins.workflow.Workflow`、 "
":class:`flowing.plugins.workflow.RunWorkflowTool`、 "
":meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.resolve_path`"
msgstr ""
":class:`flowing.plugins.workflow.Workflow`, "
":class:`flowing.plugins.workflow.RunWorkflowTool`, "
":meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.resolve_path`"

#: ../../api/flowing.plugins.workflow.rst:10
msgid "Submodules"
msgstr "Submodules"

#: ../../api/flowing.plugins.workflow.rst:13
msgid "flowing.plugins.workflow.loader module"
msgstr "flowing.plugins.workflow.loader module"

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.loader:1 of
msgid "承载 ``resolve_workflow``——按路径解析 workflow 定义文件并返回 ``Workflow`` 子类。"
msgstr "Carries ``resolve_workflow`` —— resolves a workflow definition file by path and returns the ``Workflow`` subclass."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.loader:3 of
msgid "本模块只做“路径 → 类”解析：不实例化、不运行，实例化由调用方完成 （需要 caller 与 runtime）。"
msgstr "This module only performs \"path → class\" resolution: it neither instantiates nor runs; instantiation is done by the caller (which needs a caller and a runtime)."

#: ../../api/flowing.plugins.workflow.rst:21
msgid "flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin module"
msgstr "flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin module"

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.plugin:1 of
msgid "承载 ``RunWorkflowTool`` 与 ``WorkflowPlugin``——Workflow 的 LLM 触发入口工具与扩展插件类。"
msgstr "Carries ``RunWorkflowTool`` and ``WorkflowPlugin`` —— Workflow's LLM trigger entry tool and extension plugin class."

#: ../../api/flowing.plugins.workflow.rst:29
msgid "flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow module"
msgstr "flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow module"

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow:1 of
msgid "``flowing.plugins.workflow`` —— 工作流编排扩展。"
msgstr "``flowing.plugins.workflow`` —— the workflow orchestration extension."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow:5 of
msgid ""
"本扩展提供“规则性编排”能力：编排逻辑（分支、循环、并行、串行）由 Python 代码显式写出，与 goal mode（LLM "
"按目标自主决定路径）是两种正交 的编排方式。Workflow 适用于流程已知、要确定性、可重复的场景——审批流、 "
"验证-修复循环、固定步骤流水线。使用时继承 :class:`Workflow` 实现 ``run()`` （编排主体），把编排要用的子 "
"Agent、工具、消息能力接入运行 时，然后经代码直接驱动或 ``run-workflow`` 工具（LLM 入口）拉起。"
msgstr ""
"This extension provides \"rule-based orchestration\": the orchestration logic (branches, loops, parallel, serial) is written explicitly in "
"Python code, and is one of two orthogonal orchestration styles alongside goal mode (where the LLM decides the path "
"autonomously from the goal). Workflow suits scenarios where the flow is known and determinism and repeatability are required —— approval flows, "
"verify-fix loops, fixed-step pipelines. To use it, subclass :class:`Workflow` and implement ``run()`` (the orchestration body), wire the child "
"Agents, tools, and messaging capabilities the orchestration needs into the runtime, then drive it directly from code or launch it via the ``run-workflow`` tool (the LLM entry)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow:12 of
msgid "边界（本扩展不提供）："
msgstr "Boundaries (what this extension does not provide):"

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow:14 of
msgid "不是 Agent：没有 Turn 循环、不调用 LLM、不产生消息树节点（但可以 创建并驱动 Agent）。"
msgstr "Not an Agent: no Turn loop, no LLM calls, no message-tree nodes produced (but it can create and drive Agents)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow:16 of
msgid ""
"不是声明式 DSL：workflow 定义是 Python 文件（类形态或函数形态，见 :func:`resolve_workflow`），不解析"
" mermaid / 图声明。"
msgstr ""
"Not a declarative DSL: a workflow definition is a Python file (class form or function form; see :func:`resolve_workflow`); it does not parse"
" mermaid / graph declarations."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow:20 of
msgid "注册面清单"
msgstr "Registration Surface"

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow:21 of
msgid ""
"启用方式：``runtime.install(WorkflowPlugin())`` 把 ``run-workflow`` 工具 "
"注册进全局工具注册表，之后 Agent 经 ``add_tool(\"run-workflow\")`` 绑定该工具，即可让 LLM "
"按路径拉起任意 workflow 定义。本扩展没有 实例级 ``use_workflow(self)``：``Workflow`` 基类与 "
":func:`resolve_workflow` import 即用，不需要对 Agent 做任何启用动作。 重复安装同名插件（再次 "
"``runtime.install(WorkflowPlugin())``）抛 ``ValueError``。"
msgstr ""
"Activation: ``runtime.install(WorkflowPlugin())`` registers the ``run-workflow`` tool "
"into the global tool registry; afterwards an Agent binds the tool via ``add_tool(\"run-workflow\")``, letting the LLM "
"launch any workflow definition by path. This extension has no instance-level ``use_workflow(self)``: the ``Workflow`` base class and "
":func:`resolve_workflow` are usable on import, with no activation action needed on any Agent. Installing the same-named plugin again (another "
"``runtime.install(WorkflowPlugin())``) raises ``ValueError``. "

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow:28 of
msgid ""
"注册的资源：安装时向 ``runtime.tool_registry`` 注册 :class:`RunWorkflowTool` "
"（:class:`flowing.tool.ScriptTool` 子类， 规范名 ``run-workflow``，落在 "
"``default::`` 命名空间）。不注册 provide 值、不声明 Agent 状态键、不挂 prompt 块。"
msgstr ""
"Registered resources: at install time, registers :class:`RunWorkflowTool` into ``runtime.tool_registry`` "
"(a :class:`flowing.tool.ScriptTool` subclass, canonical name ``run-workflow``, in the "
"``default::`` namespace). It registers no provide values, declares no Agent state keys, and attaches no prompt blocks."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow:32 of
msgid ""
"声明的钩子点：无（本扩展不声明新的钩子点）。Workflow 实例有自己的 "
"钩子注册表（``self.hooks``，构造时创建），使用框架预填的核心钩子点 ``before_tool_call`` / "
"``after_tool_call``——与任何 Agent 的钩子完全 独立，Agent 侧挂的 handler 不会在 workflow "
"的工具调用上触发。"
msgstr ""
"Declared hook points: none (this extension declares no new hook points). A Workflow instance has its own "
"hook registry (``self.hooks``, created at construction), using the framework's pre-filled core hook points ``before_tool_call`` / "
"``after_tool_call`` —— fully independent of any Agent's hooks; handlers registered on the Agent side never fire on the workflow's "
"tool calls."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow:36 of
msgid "挂载的钩子：无（插件本身不挂任何 handler）。"
msgstr "Attached hooks: none (the plugin itself attaches no handlers)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow:37 of
msgid ""
"未启用时的行为：不安装插件则 ``run-workflow`` 工具不存在，LLM 无法 经工具拉起 workflow；但 "
"``Workflow`` 基类与 ``resolve_workflow`` 照常 可用（代码直接驱动路径不受影响），未启用不产生任何开销。"
msgstr ""
"Behavior when not activated: without installing the plugin, the ``run-workflow`` tool does not exist and the LLM cannot launch "
"workflows via the tool; but the ``Workflow`` base class and ``resolve_workflow`` remain usable as usual (the direct code-driven path is unaffected), and no overhead is incurred when not activated."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow:42 of
msgid "对象图中的位置与生命周期"
msgstr "Position in the Object Graph and Lifecycle"

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow:43 of
msgid "Workflow 实例同时占据两个位置："
msgstr "A Workflow instance occupies two positions at once:"

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow:45 of
msgid ""
"节点树（``runtime._nodes`` 共享 ID 空间）：构造时注册，``node_id`` 取 ``workflow-*`` "
"前缀。可作根节点（``caller=None``，``_parent_id`` 指向 Runtime——代码直接拉起的顶层编排），也可作 "
"Agent 的子节点 （``_parent_id = caller.node_id``——LLM 经 ``run-workflow`` 工具 "
"拉起）。本 workflow 创建的 Agent 的 ``parent_id`` 指向本 workflow 的 ``node_id``：生命周期上"
" Workflow 是它们的亲节点，``destroy()`` 时 级联归档（从池与名录移除、session 文件保留）。"
msgstr ""
"The node tree (the shared ID space of ``runtime._nodes``): registered at construction; ``node_id`` takes the ``workflow-*`` "
"prefix. It can be a root node (``caller=None``, ``_parent_id`` points at the Runtime —— top-level orchestration launched directly from code) or a child node of an "
"Agent (``_parent_id = caller.node_id`` —— launched by the LLM via the ``run-workflow`` tool). "
"The ``parent_id`` of Agents created by this workflow points at this workflow's ``node_id``: lifecycle-wise, "
"the Workflow is their parent node, and ``destroy()`` cascade-archives them (removed from the pool and rosters, session files kept)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow:52 of
msgid ""
"provide/inject 链：本 workflow ``provide()`` 的值对它创建的全部 Agent "
"及后代可见；``inject()`` 沿 ``_parent_id`` 链上溯（workflow → caller → "
"Runtime）。注意边界：workflow 调用工具 / 创建子 Agent 时 参数由编排代码直接填，不走 inject 式填充。"
msgstr ""
"The provide/inject chain: values provided by this workflow's ``provide()`` are visible to all Agents it creates "
"and their descendants; ``inject()`` walks up the ``_parent_id`` chain (workflow → caller → "
"Runtime). Note the boundary: when a workflow calls tools / creates child Agents, parameters are filled directly by orchestration code, not via inject-style filling."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow:57 of
msgid "运行状态不持久化：每次运行拉起一个新对象，崩溃后不承诺续跑（``_nodes`` 中的 workflow 节点记录随 Runtime 退出即失效）。"
msgstr "Run state is not persisted: each run brings up a new object, and resumption after a crash is not promised (the workflow node record in ``_nodes`` becomes invalid once the Runtime exits)."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow:61 of
msgid "驱动 Agent 与工具"
msgstr "Driving Agents and Tools"

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow:62 of
msgid ""
"Workflow 驱动子 Agent 的唯一入口是 :meth:`Workflow.create_agent` （字符串类型名，委托 "
"``runtime.create_agent``），创建后直接 ``message()`` / ``query()``。没有 "
"``invoke_subagent``——那是 Agent 侧 “LLM 唤起 + SubagentEntry 解析 + 钩子 + "
"池生命周期”的包装，workflow 的编排代码自己就是包装层；workflow 路径也不经过 "
"``before/after_subagent_invoke`` 钩子（创建管线只有 ``before_create`` / "
"``after_create``）。并行无需专门 API——``asyncio.gather`` 即原语。"
msgstr ""
"A Workflow's only entry for driving child Agents is :meth:`Workflow.create_agent` (a string type name, delegated to "
"``runtime.create_agent``); after creation, call ``message()`` / ``query()`` directly. There is no "
"``invoke_subagent`` —— that is the Agent-side wrapper of \"LLM invocation + SubagentEntry resolution + hooks + "
"pool lifecycle\", and a workflow's orchestration code is itself the wrapper layer; the workflow path also does not pass through the "
"``before/after_subagent_invoke`` hooks (the creation pipeline only has ``before_create`` / "
"``after_create``). Parallelism needs no dedicated API —— ``asyncio.gather`` is the primitive."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow:70 of
msgid ""
"Workflow 的工具调用是 :meth:`Workflow.tool_call` （规范名 + 零散参数）， 走 Workflow "
"自己的钩子（``self.hooks`` 的 ``before_tool_call`` / ``after_tool_call``），与任何 "
"Agent 的钩子完全独立——Agent 侧挂的审批 / 安全 / 审计 handler 不会在 workflow 的工具调用上触发。"
msgstr ""
"A Workflow's tool call is :meth:`Workflow.tool_call` (canonical name + loose arguments), going through the Workflow's "
"own hooks (``before_tool_call`` / ``after_tool_call`` of ``self.hooks``), fully independent of any "
"Agent's hooks —— approval / safety / audit handlers registered on the Agent side never fire on the workflow's tool calls."

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow:76 of
msgid "反向驱动 caller 与异步防死锁"
msgstr "Reverse-Driving the caller and Async Deadlock Prevention"

#: flowing.plugins.workflow.workflow:77 of
msgid ""
"Workflow 可以反向驱动发起它的 Agent（``await self.caller.query(...)`` 把消息发进 caller "
"的会话并等待其回合产物）——这是刻意保留的能力，代价 是异步防死锁规则：workflow 经 ``run-workflow`` 工具拉起时一定异步"
" （后台任务 + 立即返回收据，见 :class:`RunWorkflowTool`）。死锁成因： caller 的工作循环串行，当前逻辑 "
"Turn（正在执行 ``run-workflow`` 工具） 完成前不消费新消息；若工具同步等待 workflow 完成，双方互相等待。同步 "
"执行只允许“workflow 不反向调用 caller”的场景，由调用方自行保证。"
msgstr ""
"A Workflow can reverse-drive the Agent that initiated it (``await self.caller.query(...)`` sends a message into the caller's "
"session and awaits its turn product) —— this is a deliberately retained capability, and the price is the async deadlock-prevention rule: a "
"workflow launched via the ``run-workflow`` tool always runs asynchronously (background task + immediate receipt; see "
":class:`RunWorkflowTool`). The deadlock mechanism: the caller's work loop is serial and consumes no new messages until the current logical "
"Turn (which is executing the ``run-workflow`` tool) completes; if the tool synchronously waited for the workflow to finish, the two sides would wait on each other. Synchronous "
"execution is only allowed in scenarios where \"the workflow does not call back into the caller\", which the caller must guarantee itself."

